{"seq":2,"slug":"synthetic-methods","title":"大学药学 — 药物合成方法与策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/synthetic-methods","wordCount":1743,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学药学-药物合成方法与策略\">大学药学 — 药物合成方法与策略</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>药物合成是将简单的化学原料通过一系列化学反应转变为具有药理活性的目标分子的过程。掌握药物合成方法不仅要求熟悉有机化学反应的类型和机理，还需要具备逆合成分析的思维能力——即从目标分子出发，逐步拆解回可获得的起始原料。现代药物合成正朝着绿色化学、高选择性催化和连续流技术的方向快速发展。</p>\n<p>核心知识框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>逆合成分析</strong>：由 E. J. Corey 提出的系统化方法，通过断键分析（retrosynthetic disconnection）将目标分子拆解为合成子（synthon）</li>\n<li><strong>关键反应类型</strong>：偶联反应、缩合反应、氧化还原反应、环化反应、保护/脱保护策略</li>\n<li><strong>立体选择性合成</strong>：不对称催化、手性辅助剂、酶催化等实现单一对映体的策略</li>\n<li><strong>工艺放大</strong>：从实验室克级合成到工业吨级生产的关键考量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-逆合成分析的基本原理\">一、逆合成分析的基本原理</h3><p>逆合成分析是药物合成设计的核心思维工具。其基本流程为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>目标分子 (TM)</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">⇒</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>断键</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>合成子</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">⇒</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>等价物</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>实际试剂</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{目标分子 (TM)} \\xRightarrow{\\text{断键}} \\text{合成子} \\xRightarrow{\\text{等价物}} \\text{实际试剂}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3693em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标分子</span><span class=\"mord\"> (TM)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1193em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">断键</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.67em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.56em;min-width:1.526em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.56em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 560\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399738 392l\n-10 10c-34 36-62.7 77-86 123-3.3 8-5 13.3-5 16 0 5.3 6.7 8 20 8 7.3 0 12.2-.5\n 14.5-1.5 2.3-1 4.8-4.5 7.5-10.5 49.3-97.3 121.7-169.3 217-216 28-14 57.3-25 88\n-33 6.7-2 11-3.8 13-5.5 2-1.7 3-4.2 3-7.5s-1-5.8-3-7.5c-2-1.7-6.3-3.5-13-5.5-68\n-17.3-128.2-47.8-180.5-91.5-52.3-43.7-93.8-96.2-124.5-157.5-9.3-8-15.3-12.3-18\n-13h-6c-12 .7-18 4-18 10 0 2 1.7 7 5 15 23.3 46 52 87 86 123l10 10H0v40h399782\nc-328 0 0 0 0 0l10 8c26.7 20 65.7 43 117 69-2.7 2-6 3.7-10 5-36.7 16-72.3 37.3\n-107 64l-10 8H0v40zM0 157v40h399730v-40zm0 194v40h399730v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.03em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1493em;vertical-align:-0.03em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合成子</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1193em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">等价物</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.67em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.56em;min-width:1.526em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.56em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 560\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399738 392l\n-10 10c-34 36-62.7 77-86 123-3.3 8-5 13.3-5 16 0 5.3 6.7 8 20 8 7.3 0 12.2-.5\n 14.5-1.5 2.3-1 4.8-4.5 7.5-10.5 49.3-97.3 121.7-169.3 217-216 28-14 57.3-25 88\n-33 6.7-2 11-3.8 13-5.5 2-1.7 3-4.2 3-7.5s-1-5.8-3-7.5c-2-1.7-6.3-3.5-13-5.5-68\n-17.3-128.2-47.8-180.5-91.5-52.3-43.7-93.8-96.2-124.5-157.5-9.3-8-15.3-12.3-18\n-13h-6c-12 .7-18 4-18 10 0 2 1.7 7 5 15 23.3 46 52 87 86 123l10 10H0v40h399782\nc-328 0 0 0 0 0l10 8c26.7 20 65.7 43 117 69-2.7 2-6 3.7-10 5-36.7 16-72.3 37.3\n-107 64l-10 8H0v40zM0 157v40h399730v-40zm0 194v40h399730v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.03em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际试剂</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>断键分析时需要考虑以下因素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择分子中最容易构建的化学键进行断裂</li>\n<li>优先断裂杂原子-碳键（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C—N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C—N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C—N</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C—O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C—O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C—O</span></span></span></span></span></span>），因为这类键通常有成熟的构建方法</li>\n<li>识别对称性元素，简化合成路线</li>\n<li>选择商业可得的起始原料</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以布洛芬的工业合成为例，BHC 公司开发的绿色合成路线仅需三步：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>反应类型</th>\n<th>试剂</th>\n<th>产物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Friedel-Crafts 酰基化</td>\n<td>异丁苯 + 乙酸酐 / HF 催化</td>\n<td>对异丁基苯乙酮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>催化加氢</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> / Pd-C + 雷尼镍</td>\n<td>对异丁基苯乙醇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>羰基化</td>\n<td>CO / Pd 催化</td>\n<td>布洛芬</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条路线的原子经济性极高，三步反应中几乎所有原子都进入了最终产物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-药物合成中的关键反应\">二、药物合成中的关键反应</h3><p><strong>Suzuki 偶联反应</strong>：钯催化的芳基硼酸与芳基卤代物的交叉偶联，是构建联苯结构的首选方法。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Ar—B(OH)</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Ar’—X</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><msub><mtext>Pd(PPh</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>base</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Ar—Ar’</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—B(OH)}_2 + \\text{Ar&#x27;—X} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd(PPh}_3)_4, \\text{base}} \\text{Ar—Ar&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—B(OH)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar’—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd(PPh</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1389em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—Ar’</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>该反应条件温和、官能团耐受性好，广泛用于沙坦类降压药（如缬沙坦的联苯基团）的合成。</p>\n<p><strong>酰胺键的构建</strong>：酰胺键是药物分子中最常见的连接方式之一。常用方法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>酰氯法：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RCOCl</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>R’NH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mtext>RCONHR’</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RCOCl} + \\text{R&#x27;NH}_2 \\rightarrow \\text{RCONHR&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RCOCl</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’NH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RCONHR’</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>缩合剂法：使用 EDC/HOBt、HATU 等缩合试剂直接将羧酸与胺缩合</li>\n<li>酶催化法：使用脂肪酶或转肽酶在温和条件下形成酰胺键</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>环化反应</strong>：构建杂环骨架的基础方法。Fischer 吲哚合成、Hantzsch 吡啶合成、Biginelli 反应等经典命名反应在药物合成中广泛使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-不对称合成策略\">三、不对称合成策略</h3><p>单一对映体药物的合成是现代药物化学的核心挑战。主要策略包括：</p>\n<p><strong>催化不对称氢化</strong>：使用手性配体修饰的金属催化剂实现烯烃的不对称加氢。Knowles 因发展了 DIPAMP 配体用于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>-DOPA 的工业合成而获 2001 年诺贝尔化学奖：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected &#x27;EOF&#x27;, got &#x27;^&#x27; at position 48: …ext{Rh(DIPAMP)]^̲+, H}_2} L\\text…\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{脱氢氨基酸衍生物} \\xrightarrow{[\\text{Rh(DIPAMP)]^+, H}_2} L\\text{-DOPA 前体} \\quad (ee &gt; 95\\%)</span></div><p><strong>手性拆分</strong>：将消旋混合物通过结晶、色谱或酶促动力学拆分获得单一对映体。虽然理论上最大收率仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>，但动态动力学拆分（DKR）技术可以将收率提升至接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>手性池策略</strong>：以天然手性化合物（氨基酸、糖类、萜类）为起始原料，保留其手性中心进行结构修饰。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-绿色合成与工艺化学\">四、绿色合成与工艺化学</h3><p>传统药物合成常使用大量有机溶剂和有毒试剂，产生严重的环境问题。绿色化学的十二原则指导下，现代药物工艺正在发生变革：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原子经济性</strong>：设计反应时尽量让所有原子进入产物，减少副产物</li>\n<li><strong>催化反应</strong>：用催化量的试剂取代化学计量的试剂</li>\n<li><strong>溶剂替代</strong>：用水、超临界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或无溶剂条件取代有害有机溶剂</li>\n<li><strong>连续流技术</strong>：在微反应器中连续进行反应，提高传热传质效率，减少安全隐患</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[绿色合成策略] --&gt; B[原子经济性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[催化技术]&#10;    A --&gt; D[溶剂替代]&#10;    A --&gt; E[连续流工艺]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Diels-Alder/点击化学]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[不对称催化/酶催化]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[水相反应/无溶剂]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[微反应器/流动化学]\">graph LR\n    A[绿色合成策略] --&gt; B[原子经济性]\n    A --&gt; C[催化技术]\n    A --&gt; D[溶剂替代]\n    A --&gt; E[连续流工艺]\n    B --&gt; B1[Diels-Alder/点击化学]\n    C --&gt; C1[不对称催化/酶催化]\n    D --&gt; D1[水相反应/无溶剂]\n    E --&gt; E1[微反应器/流动化学]</pre><h3 id=\"五-从实验室到工厂的工艺放大\">五、从实验室到工厂的工艺放大</h3><p>克级合成到吨级生产之间存在巨大的工程挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>传热问题</strong>：放热反应在大规模时散热困难，需重新设计加料速度和冷却系统</li>\n<li><strong>搅拌效率</strong>：反应器体积增大后，混合均匀性下降</li>\n<li><strong>安全评估</strong>：对热失控风险进行量热分析（DSC、ARC）</li>\n<li><strong>成本控制</strong>：选择更廉价的试剂和溶剂，优化反应步骤减少工序</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>对阿托伐他汀的结构进行逆合成分析，提出两条可能的合成路线，比较它们的步骤数和原子经济性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释 Suzuki 偶联反应中钯催化剂的催化循环机制，画出氧化加成、转金属化、还原消除三个关键步骤。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某手性药物的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ee</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span></span></span></span></span> 值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>92</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">92\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">92%</span></span></span></span></span>，计算其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>-异构体和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>-异构体各占的百分比。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较酰氯法和 EDC/HOBt 缩合法构建酰胺键的优缺点。在哪些情况下应优先选用缩合剂法？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一条从苯甲醛出发，经 4 步以内合成扁桃酸（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-羟基苯乙酸）的路线。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《有机合成设计》</strong>（巨勇、席婵娟编著）：系统讲解逆合成分析方法论</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;The Art of Drug Synthesis&quot; (D. Johnson, J. Li)</strong>：收录大量上市药物的工业合成路线</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Strategic Applications of Named Reactions in Organic Synthesis&quot; (Kurti, Czako)</strong>：命名反应在药物合成中的实际应用</li>\n<li><strong>ACS Green Chemistry Institute</strong>：绿色化学资源平台</li>\n<li><strong>Organic Process Research &amp; Development</strong> 期刊：关注药物工艺化学的专业期刊</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>药物合成方法是连接化学理论与药物产品的桥梁。逆合成分析提供了系统的设计思路，关键偶联反应和环化反应构成了合成工具箱的核心。不对称合成技术解决了手性药物的生产难题，而绿色化学和工艺放大知识则确保合成方案能够安全、经济地转化为工业规模生产。学习药物合成时，建议将经典反应机理与具体药物实例结合记忆，形成&quot;反应—应用&quot;的双向知识网络。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学药学 — 药物合成方法与策略","id":"大学药学-药物合成方法与策略"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、逆合成分析的基本原理","id":"一-逆合成分析的基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"二、药物合成中的关键反应","id":"二-药物合成中的关键反应"},{"level":3,"text":"三、不对称合成策略","id":"三-不对称合成策略"},{"level":3,"text":"四、绿色合成与工艺化学","id":"四-绿色合成与工艺化学"},{"level":3,"text":"五、从实验室到工厂的工艺放大","id":"五-从实验室到工厂的工艺放大"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学药学 — 药物的化学结构与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/drug-structure"},"next":{"title":"大学药学 — 构效关系与药物设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/structure-activity"}}